{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc7d INSPECT ALIENS, BUILD AN EMPIRE \ud83c\udfe8</h2>You are the first line of defense and the ultimate host! In this vibrant pixel-art manager, your job is to turn a rundown station into the galaxy's #1 hub. Carefully inspect documents of <strong>15 unique alien species</strong>, deny entry to suspicious characters, and stamp passports like a pro.<br><br>Use your hard-earned resources to expand. Build <strong>capsule hotels, cinemas, and karaoke bars</strong>. Transform your station from a checkpoint into a bustling resort where every visitor leaves happy (and empty-pocketed)!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571990/extras/4ae05e7d9feeffa5effaef0648062d43.poster.avif?t=1769980233\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571990/extras/4ae05e7d9feeffa5effaef0648062d43.webm?t=1769980233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571990/extras/4ae05e7d9feeffa5effaef0648062d43.mp4?t=1769980233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2696\ufe0f FIND YOUR MANAGEMENT STYLE</h2>Love the thrill of inspection? Handle every passport yourself for maximum profit. <br><br>Prefer being an architect? Hire staff to automate check-ins. You can then focus on building the perfect station, managing production chains, and handling the daily chaos of a galactic hub.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571990/extras/9beb8d829ca9168269f567073e822746.poster.avif?t=1769980233\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571990/extras/9beb8d829ca9168269f567073e822746.webm?t=1769980233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571990/extras/9beb8d829ca9168269f567073e822746.mp4?t=1769980233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 SURVIVE THE CHAOS</h2>Life in space is unpredictable. Be ready for anything, from a beetle parasite outbreak to mysterious traders and runaway inflation. Watch out for criminals like pyromaniacs and thieves trying to slip past your security!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 YOUR STATION, YOUR RULES</h2>Will you be a strict gatekeeper or a benevolent host? Follow the branching story campaign with multiple endings or build freely in Endless Mode. Run the galaxy\u2019s most interesting transit point your way!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1571990/605e5c649bc258cf13543efa95af2eacd014e003.jpg"},{"name":"The Naturalist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1571990/35368411fa6d8a4ed68e09805e365f2325c381e0.jpg"},{"name":"You are fired","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1571990/50c7fc02f15c31dd5094c894961f2e7c7d76adc3.jpg"},{"name":"Burn brightly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1571990/73aed5054949980274506d789fb6f0660ad594c9.jpg"},{"name":"Parasites from outer space","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1571990/f02a27f70a2c7e7651225ed51c94637ef5195bca.jpg"},{"name":"Garbage Pass Station","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1571990/19fc89273d8b409be6f2134eddd4eeb87cb75558.jpg"},{"name":"Space Cinema","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1571990/4abd99ba599749ce25941415880910eb119e4ef2.jpg"},{"name":"The Bureaucrat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco